# Build
/target
/runs

# npm package: build artifacts
packages/npm/*.tgz

.env/

# Git worktrees (used by superpowers:using-git-worktrees)
/.worktrees/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Crash dumps
# kernel.core_pattern is "core" with core_uses_pid=1 here, so any process that
# crashes while its CWD is inside this repo drops a core.<pid> file (one was
# 351 MB). The sysctl is read-only inside this container, so ignore the pid form
# instead. Deliberately does NOT match core.rs / core.py.
/core
core.[0-9]*
*.core

# Environment variables (may contain secrets)
.env

# Python (dev scripts)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/venv/

# Web (separate frontend, not part of core)
/web/

# Node
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
package-lock.json
!extensions/vscode/package-lock.json
!tools/weixin-bridge/package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Temp / WIP files
site/index-new.html

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Config with secrets
config.toml

# Personal project instructions (loaded by RustCode, never committed)
.rustcode.user.md

# Logs
/datalog/
/site/datalog/
/test-report.md

# Local docs (not pushed to remote)
/doc/
backend.log
.venv-swebench/

# RustCode local data (graph cache, etc.)
.rustcode/

# Claude Code's project instructions — kept locally for the IDE/agent that
# maintains rustcode source, but NOT pushed (it's personal guidance, may
# diverge between contributors, and shouldn't imply official project rules).
/CLAUDE.md
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
# Scratch space for the local Claude session (issue scrapes, notes,
# intermediate analysis artifacts). Personal to the contributor and
# not part of the source tree.
.claude/rustcode_issues_*.json
.claude/issues_*.json
.claude/issues_*.md
.claude/open_mrs.json

# Local eval harness — kept off version control. Includes scripts,
# baseline/config TOML (may hold API keys), case inputs, run outputs,
# and sample projects. The whole directory lives on disk for reruns
# but never ships.
scripts/eval/
docs/superpowers
.mcp.json

# Release artifacts. Matches any `dist/` directory (incl. `webui/dist`):
# the release/upload scripts copy built binaries here but never check them in.
dist/

# v2 (kernel-spike) local design specs / backlog — working docs kept on disk for
# the contributor, NEVER committed (turn-end auto-commit would otherwise sweep them).
docs/c1-assembly-spec.md
docs/mcp-capability-spec.md
docs/overflow-compaction-spec.md
docs/session-persistence-recall-spec.md
docs/system-prompt-parity-spec.md
docs/v2-port-backlog.md

# Superpowers plugin state
.superpowers/
.plan_docs
extensions/vscode/resources/bin/
.kiro
# Staging dir for atomic release publishing (scripts/release-publish.sh).
# The release/<version>/ committed dirs themselves are NOT ignored.
release/.tmp/
# RustCode local-scope configs (machine-specific)
.rustcode/local/
crates/rustcode-codingplan-crypto/
scripts/build-official.sh
build-official.sh
build-official-vscode.sh
build-official-jetbrains.sh

# git worktrees
.worktrees/

extensions/vscode/webview/webview.css
extensions/vscode/webview/webview.css.map
extensions/vscode/webview/webview.js
extensions/vscode/webview/webview.js.map
.hooks.json
extensions/jetbrains/.spec_docs
# 本地评测脚手架(A/B 对比脚本、日志、测试仓),不入库
.aacr-eval/
.superpowers/

.liftoff/

# Codex 子代理在项目目录生成的运行时目录(external subagent driver)
.codex/
# [2026-09-03] `.codebuddy/` 已从本忽略清单移除,改为随仓库跟踪 --
# 它承载 project 级 Agent 定义(agents/)、协作规则(rules/)与运行看板(artifacts/),
# 需随仓库共享给团队。此前被忽略导致新克隆拿不到任何 Agent 定义。
# 注意:勿再加回 `.codebuddy/`,否则子路径无法用 `!` 重新纳入。
.codegraph/
.codeartsdoer/

# 本地 CodeArts 配置包(含第三方 API key),严禁入库
codearts.zip

# 本地代码搜索索引缓存(zvec grep 工具生成,勿入库)
.zvec-grep/
CODEBUDDY.md

# CodeBuddy 的**运行时**目录(与 .codebuddy/agents、rules 相对):
# memory/ 是本机跨会话工作笔记、teams/ 是子代理会话邮箱、artifacts/ 是 Agent 运行产物
# (实现报告、交付清单、审计看板等),均随机器/会话变化,不随仓库共享。
# 注意只忽略这些子路径,勿写整个 `.codebuddy/`(见上方 2026-09-03 注记:agents/、rules 仍随仓库跟踪)。
# [2026-09-12] artifacts/ 改回忽略(2026-09-03 曾决定跟踪,现按团队口径仅共享 agents/rules 源码)。
.codebuddy/memory/
.codebuddy/teams/
.codebuddy/artifacts/

# Other AI coding assistant / CLI local workspaces (defensive — never tracked).
# These are machine/session-local artifacts produced by various AI coding tools;
# rustcode's own project config (AGENTS.md, config examples) is intentionally
# NOT ignored here — only third-party assistant working dirs are.
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.aider*
.windsurf/
.continue/
.continuerc
.tabnine/
.cody/
.gemini/
.trae/
.qoder/
.amp/
.augment/
.devin/
.copilot/
.github/copilot/
.agent*
.droid/
.pulumi/env/
.dummy/
.omo/
